                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "55be3087-9e3e-3eb1-b686-a883eb90ec38",
                        "entry_id": "6efb0884-4027-3cd3-a99e-6e1d7465bc2a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "awe (feeling of fear and reverence)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ffddb39-0b79-4e57-9c51-19f65807b9a8",
                                "sense_id": "55be3087-9e3e-3eb1-b686-a883eb90ec38",
                                "text": "Толстый хотел было возразить что-то, но на лице у тонкого было написано столько благоговения, сладости и почтительной кислоты, что тайного советника стошнило.",
                                "translation": "The fat man was about to make some protest, but the face of the thin man wore an expression of such reverence, sugariness, and mawkish respectfulness that the privy councillor was sickened.",
                                "english": "The fat man was about to make some protest, but the face of the thin man wore an expression of such reverence, sugariness, and mawkish respectfulness that the privy councillor was sickened."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
